      "description": "原生选择器；手机以弹性宽度使用。",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\">筛选球队<select aria-label=\"筛选球队\"><option>所有球队</option></select></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;color:var(--ink,#243651);font-size:13px;font-family:var(--sans,'Score Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);}.ds-field select{border:1px solid var(--line,#d8e1ee);border-radius:8px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#243651);min-height:38px;max-width:180px;padding:6px 30px 6px 12px;font:inherit;accent-color:var(--blue,#244be2)}.ds-field select:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#244be2);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
