      "description": "真实赛事导航的默认与当前状态。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-sports\" aria-label=\"赛事项目\"><a href=\"#football\" aria-current=\"page\">足球</a><a href=\"#nba\">NBA</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-sports{display:flex;gap:5px;overflow:auto;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#d8e1ee);padding-bottom:9px;font-family:var(--sans,'Score Sans','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif);}.ds-sports a{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:40px;padding:8px 16px;border-radius:7px;white-space:nowrap;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#57677f);text-decoration:none}.ds-sports a:hover{background:var(--wash,#e9efff)}.ds-sports a[aria-current]{background:var(--blue,#244be2);color:var(--surface,#fff);font-weight:600}.ds-sports a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--blue,#244be2);outline-offset:3px;}"
    },
